   $colorCyan; we keep the cantonal colour change *and* add the visible focus
   ring the canton's accessibility guidance asks for. */
.zh-input:focus-visible,
.zh-select:focus-visible {
  border-color: var(--zh-cyan);
  outline: 3px solid var(--zh-color-focus);
  outline-offset: 2px;
}"""
assert old_focus in s
s = s.replace(old_focus, new_focus)
open(p,'w').write(s)
print('inputs updated')
